{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-notify-xc#card-zh","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-notify-xc","commit":"90e72d83925b1cdaedd3a450851bfb444e033380","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify-xc 是面向 DSH 网页端的任务通知插件。它订阅会话运行状态和待处理交互，在任务完成、运行出错或出现提问、批准、计划审阅时发送浏览器系统通知；等待子代理或后台代理任务时可延后完成提醒。设置页提供通知类别、发送模式、子代理过滤、常驻提醒和工作区名称等选项，点击通知可返回对应会话，也可批量清除当前页面仍持有的通知。适合希望离开 DSH 页面时仍能留意任务进度并及时处理请求的网页用户。使用前需要浏览器支持并授权 Notification API；不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1062-1108","lib/client.js:390-420","lib/client.js:722-755","lib/client.js:931-977"]}
{"unit_id":"xchannel1987__dsh-notify-xc#card-en","repo":"xchannel1987/dsh-notify-xc","commit":"90e72d83925b1cdaedd3a450851bfb444e033380","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify-xc alerts DSH web users when tasks finish, fail, or need an answer or approval. Alerts can wait for delegated work, and clicking one reopens its session. Browser notifications must be supported and permitted; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1062-1108","lib/client.js:390-420","lib/client.js:722-755","lib/client.js:931-977"]}
